              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 24:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ebyo nibyo bigambo ebi MUKAMA yaagambiire eihanga ryanyu ryona aha rushozi ruri, ari ahagati omu muriro, n'omu kicu, n'omu mwirima ndindindi, naabigamba n'eiraka rihango; tiyaagira kindi eki yaayongyeraho. Yaabihandiika aha bishate bibiri by'amabaare, yaabimpa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku mwahuriire eiraka eririkuruga omu mwirima, mwareeba orushozi nirwaka omuriro, abeebembezi b'enganda zaanyu boona n'abakuru baanyu baanyirira haihi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwangira muti: Reeba MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu yaatworeka ekitiinisa kye n'obukuru bwe, kandi twahurira eiraka rye niriruga omu muriro; eri izooba twareeba Ruhanga ku arikugamba n'omuntu, akagumaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu twaza kwitirwa ki? Guriya muriro mwingi ka gwaza kutumaraho. Ku turaagarukye kuhurira eiraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu, nitwija kufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu n'oha omu bantu boona orahuriire eiraka rya Ruhanga otahwaho naagambira ahagati omu muriro, nk'oku twarihurira, akagumaho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba niiwe wairira haihi, ohurire ebi MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu arikugamba byona, otugambire ebi MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu araakugambire byona; naitwe nitwija kubihurira, tubyorobere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
